Training content notice: every product, company, document, study and person in
this application is fictional. Section codes, form numbers and XML element names
follow public ICH, FDA, EU, PMDA and CDSCO specifications; the app does not reproduce any agency
form, portal, gateway or logo, and its output is not suitable for a real submission.
The gateway and review clock are simulations. The completion certificate is a portfolio
exercise, not an accreditation. Canada, Switzerland and ASEAN ACTD headings in the region
comparison come from Health Canada, Swissmedic and ASEAN public guidance.

